# Manual checks with the JetBrains / VS Code REST client.
# Environments: tests/http/http-client.env.json

# @name checkSystemStatus
### Health check (V1)
GET {{apiUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

# @name openApiSpec
### OpenAPI specification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/docs.jsonopenapi
Accept: application/vnd.openapi+json
